    "detailed_description": "Parkonauts is a 1-4 player local-multiplayer party game, where you work together with your friends as a team to build a successful career in parking lot business.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/1113467ec7fc739aa6434760d23bac2d.poster.avif?t=1740936689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/1113467ec7fc739aa6434760d23bac2d.webm?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/1113467ec7fc739aa6434760d23bac2d.mp4?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Put your driving skills to the test!  <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>* Try different parkings maps with unexpected obstacles<br>* Play the story mode solo or team up with some friends<br>* Drive a lots of cars with unique handling modes<br>* Try to create a unique colorful character to strengthen our own identity<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/68cddb807c98434f504d4b0945052d79.poster.avif?t=1740936689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/68cddb807c98434f504d4b0945052d79.webm?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/68cddb807c98434f504d4b0945052d79.mp4?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/67cecb10d4f9b84780c22f672e84d067.poster.avif?t=1740936689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/67cecb10d4f9b84780c22f672e84d067.webm?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1720020/extras/67cecb10d4f9b84780c22f672e84d067.mp4?t=1740936689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Try our special physics in pursuit of your parking spot!",
